    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The size and position of a rectangle depends on the aspect ratio of the media (16:9 or 4:3), the layer’s [`bounds`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/QuartzCore/CALayer/bounds), and the value of its [`videoGravity`](avplayerlayer/videogravity.md) property.",
      "ko": "사각형의 크기와 위치는 미디어의 종횡비(16:9 또는 4:3), 레이어의 [`bounds`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/QuartzCore/CALayer/bounds), 그리고 [`videoGravity`](avplayerlayer/videogravity.md) 속성 값에 따라 달라집니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c3edf0a6660ad8e070e0fb86c2063a46827a1ddcf2507fccedba6d4a2e6ac9dc",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "This property is key-value observable.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 key-value 관찰 가능합니다.",
